A.b1("-> filter on full table by using top bar <filter> icon. [ALPHA] actually not working, only visually sets up.")
A.b1("-> tap on a line of a list to acces its formulary. a form gives you state allowed depending your rights and actions available such as <save, delete>.")
A.b1("-> [ACCESS] enter in top search bar in the middle of the screen, app path to the form. (can also be use to access a list view)")
A.b1("-> only request, task shows workflow completion, on top of their forms. it consists of a simple bar declining steps with a list of parrallel subtask depending on step.")
A.b1("-> grey color define not reached step, vivid color step is done or currently doing, icons in subtask will give you its current state (done or doing). task can show you a optionnal hub under main workflow, by this you can choose wich are the next step to launch.")
